    "detailed_description": "<strong>Project Faceless</strong> is an ultra realistic 4-player, online co-op, psychological horror game built using the latest technologies from Unreal Engine 5. You and your friends must find the papers scattered around the map whilst actively being hunted by the faceless creature. Use your flashlight and communication skills to scour the map to find the papers as the difficulty increasingly rises with each paper found.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/84dba273afdf08393c517c6ae3981ac5.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>The <strong>faceless creature</strong> will relentlessly pursue you throughout the environment as you collect the necessary papers. As you progress and draw nearer to your objective, the creature's behavior will become increasingly challenging and aggressive. Should the creature locate you and you fail to evade it, you will face certain demise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/1b321f71c5757da404a397e40ce467e2.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>Leveraging the advanced technologies of <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, we have strived to deliver a next-generation gaming experience characterized by stunning graphics and an immersive horror atmosphere. Our goal is to captivate players with visual excellence and heightened suspense, pushing the boundaries of what is possible in modern gaming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/6ed5caf4e11f800e1b913e28f7be5dee.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Project Faceless</strong> is an ultra realistic 4-player, online co-op, psychological horror game built using the latest technologies from Unreal Engine 5. You and your friends must find the papers scattered around the map whilst actively being hunted by the faceless creature. Use your flashlight and communication skills to scour the map to find the papers as the difficulty increasingly rises with each paper found.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/84dba273afdf08393c517c6ae3981ac5.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>The <strong>faceless creature</strong> will relentlessly pursue you throughout the environment as you collect the necessary papers. As you progress and draw nearer to your objective, the creature's behavior will become increasingly challenging and aggressive. Should the creature locate you and you fail to evade it, you will face certain demise.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/1b321f71c5757da404a397e40ce467e2.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span><br><br>Leveraging the advanced technologies of <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>, we have strived to deliver a next-generation gaming experience characterized by stunning graphics and an immersive horror atmosphere. Our goal is to captivate players with visual excellence and heightened suspense, pushing the boundaries of what is possible in modern gaming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702000/extras/6ed5caf4e11f800e1b913e28f7be5dee.avif?t=1722106280\" width=600 height=244 /></span>",
